  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "9.2.2 - A custom mapping given a reader and no writer took every other column in the mapping off the path that writes straight from an entity, because writing needs a getter for every column and none was built for one that never writes. Such a column now writes what it always wrote, a null, through its own column's Format so that its null formatter still decides what nothing looks like. This is the last corner of the defect fixed in 9.2.1. The build dependencies also move up - Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp to 5.9.0, the test SDK to 18.11.0 and MSTest to 4.5.1 - which raises the compiler a consuming project needs, since the source generator ships inside this package; a .NET 10 SDK already satisfies it. No API changes.",
